
## Outros valores de `display` ##


 Valores de <code class=focus>display</code> para posicionamento especializado do HTML 

* Tabelas
    * <code class=focus>table</code> - equivalente a `<table>`
    * <code class=focus>table-cell</code> - equivalente a `<td>`
    * <code class=focus>table-row</code> - equivalente a `<tr>`
* Listas
    * <code class=focus>list-item</code> equivalente a `<li>`
* Caixas flexíveis <span class=litle>(CSS3)</span>
    * <code class=focus>flex</code> 
    * <code class=focus>inline-flex</code>
* Grelha <span class=litle>(CSS3)</span>
    * <code class=focus>grid</code> 
    * <code class=focus>inline-grid</code>
